      "text": "WITHOUT TANNING:\n    Wet: putrefies (bacterial decomposition)\n    Dry: hard, stiff, brittle (glue-like gelatin)\n    Neither state is useful leather"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-LEATHERWORKING.md#006",
