      },
      "text": "TANNING OBJECTIVE:\n    Cross-link the collagen fiber network\n    → stabilized against water (won't gelatinize when wet)\n    → stabilized against microbes (resists decomposition)\n    → mechanically useful (flexible, tough, durable)"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-LEATHERWORKING.md#007",
      "path": [
        "09-LEATHERWORKING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
