        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Leatherworking",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "THREE MAJOR TANNING CHEMISTRIES:\n  ┌────────────────┬──────────────┬──────────────────────────────┐\n  │ Vegetable      │ Chrome       │ Aldehyde                     │\n  │ (~7,000 BCE)   │ (1893)       │ (20th century)               │\n  ├────────────────┼──────────────┼──────────────────────────────┤\n  │ 3-6 months     │ 1-2 days     │ Hours                        │\n  │ Pit or drum    │ Drum         │ Drum                         │\n  │ Firm, develops │ Soft, pliable│ Soft, pale, washable         │\n  │ patina         │ uniform      │                              │\n  │ Warm colors    │ \"Wet blue\"   │ Cream/white                  │\n  │ ~10-15% global │ ~80-85%      │ ~5%                          │\n  │ Biodegradable  │ Cr waste     │ Less toxic than chrome       │\n  └────────────────┴──────────────┴──────────────────────────────┘\n```"
    },
